                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32f880a8-56dd-3751-88a6-1ebd462a1f6d",
                        "entry_id": "9672d686-7e3e-3c1d-9847-d2a563bbccbb",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Entre les galaxies."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Science-fiction"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1cc02c1-6a5d-40e6-baa3-aa1889623cdd",
                                "sense_id": "32f880a8-56dd-3751-88a6-1ebd462a1f6d",
                                "text": "Mes fréquents séjours dans les observatoires du monde entier n’ont jamais émoussé le plaisir que j’éprouve à communiquer avec l’univers par ce messager exceptionnel qu’est la lumière. […] Je frémis quand je pense que la lumière de cette galaxie qui parvient maintenant jusqu’à mon télescope a commencé son voyage intergalactique avant même que certains atomes de mon corps n’aient été forgés par l’alchimie nucléaire d’une étoile massive !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "814b424e-b75a-4aa9-9534-aaa54f204578",
                        "source_entry_id": "9672d686-7e3e-3c1d-9847-d2a563bbccbb",
                        "source_sense_id": "32f880a8-56dd-3751-88a6-1ebd462a1f6d",
                        "target_lang_word": "intergalactic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "intergalactic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0b3c662-6446-3f3c-ae9f-ac5149d5141a",
                                        "entry_id": "290f7321-a22d-3c63-b047-1eb1a7b6581b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Occurring between galaxies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3784ce37-6c6d-44c3-81a0-426396102213",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b3c662-6446-3f3c-ae9f-ac5149d5141a",
                                                "text": "Men In Black 3 finagles its way out of this predicament by literally resetting the clock with a time-travel premise that makes Will Smith both a contemporary intergalactic cop in the late 1960s and a stranger to Josh Brolin, who plays the younger version of Smith’s stone-faced future partner, Tommy Lee Jones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8aa02e77-d62e-4534-8cbb-0db84291baca",
                                                "sense_id": "b0b3c662-6446-3f3c-ae9f-ac5149d5141a",
                                                "text": "Last week saw perhaps the first major showdown between the pseudo cryptolibertarianism they both espouse and that old-fashioned, resolutely analogue concept known as the nation state. For anyone who has spent any time pondering the intergalactic levels of entitlement among the tech broligarchy and the – until now – total impunity they’ve faced, the arrest and subsequent charging of Durov was a singular moment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c45dc7db-3760-3632-923a-0513cf6b6ee3",
                                        "entry_id": "290f7321-a22d-3c63-b047-1eb1a7b6581b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Occurring across a single galaxy, interstellar."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "proscribed"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3bc1ee1-8aba-4491-9baa-bd85c5d3bb67",
                                                "sense_id": "c45dc7db-3760-3632-923a-0513cf6b6ee3",
                                                "text": "They say he's a member of the Exchange – you know, the big intergalactic criminal organization."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "75cce769-553b-4acc-a14f-4dc7c9e4fc3e",
                        "source_entry_id": "9672d686-7e3e-3c1d-9847-d2a563bbccbb",
